 "title": "The Average Ensemble Energy is Equal to the Observed Energy of a System",
 "short": "The average ensemble energy",
 "lead": "The energy we measure for a system is an average: each state's energy weighted by its Boltzmann probability. Written in terms of the partition function, that average becomes a derivative of ln Q.",
